WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:02.292
(wind whooshing)

00:00:02.292 --> 00:00:03.833
(dramatic music)

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:08.833
(pickaxe clanking)
(dramatic music continuing)

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
(dog whimpering)

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.167
(dramatic music continuing)

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:19.792
(pickaxe clanking)

00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:23.583
(Aatami yelling)

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:28.583
(dog barking)
(dramatic music continuing)

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.333
- Get off the horse.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.292
(horse neighing)

00:00:36.292 --> 00:00:38.292
This old fucker is a gold miner.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.208
We're rich boys!

00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:42.500
(dog barking)

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.458
- Get down on your knees.

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:45.625
- [Nazi] Fuck him up!

00:00:46.917 --> 00:00:48.583
(laughing)

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.583
- We got gold!

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:51.333
(knife singing)

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:53.625
(body thudding)

00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:54.625
(soldier grunting)

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:58.083
(gun chattering)

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.042
(Aatami grunting)

00:01:01.042 --> 00:01:03.833
(intense music)

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.750
- [Wolf] He was a Finnish
commander.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.417
Lost his home and his family in
the war.

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:09.292
♪ Ho ♪

00:01:09.292 --> 00:01:11.083
He became a one man death squad.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.083
(soldier yelling)

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:13.417
(engine revving)

00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:15.042
(gun chattering)

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.000
- He's one mean mother fucker

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.875
that you do not want to mess
with.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.333
(landmine whooshing)

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:25.208
- [Helldorf] Fire!

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:27.208
(guns chattering)

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.208
(dramatic music)

00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:32.833
- You'll see what happens when
you take everything from him.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.708
(Aatami yelling)

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:36.833
(gun chattering)

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:38.833
- Do you really believe that
he's immortal?

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:41.500
- [Aino] No, he just refuses to
die.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.500
- How many mines did you bury
here?

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.417
- All of them.

00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:49.000
- You, and you.

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:52.833
(dramatic music)

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.792
(mine whooshing)

00:01:54.792 --> 00:01:56.417
(leg whooshing)

00:01:56.417 --> 00:02:01.583
(dramatic music continuing)

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.708
(Nazi yelling)

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:06.375
- This is not about who's the
strongest.

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:07.833
This is about not giving up.

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:09.792
(bike whirring)

00:02:09.792 --> 00:02:11.625
We have a word for that in
Finland.

00:02:11.625 --> 00:02:14.083
(Aatami yelling)

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:15.083
- [Narrator] Sisu!

00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:18.625
(dramatic music continuing)

00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:21.625
- We might have a problem.

00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:22.833
♪ Ho ♪

